:: effects speaker=narrator scene="effects" beat="resolution"
! immediate play_sfx(dial_return)
> speaker=analyst portrait="ready" camera="close" @effects_line
  I can burn the comparison to oxide tape, but the console will demand your cipher key.
! deferred advance_quest(missing_train, confirmed)
! blocking grant_item(oxide_tape)
> speaker=operator portrait="resolved" beat="choice" @effects_prompt
  The case is no longer clean, only legible.
  ? quest=case_lamplight tone="resolved" sfx=carrier_tone @finish_watch
    Seal the Lamplight file and keep LACUNA on the line.
    -> END

:: deferred_anchor speaker=narrator scene="effects" beat="deferred_anchor"
! deferred advance_quest(missing_train, confirmed)
> speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert" @deferred_anchor_line
  Deferred comparison queued for the Lamplight file.
-> END
